ntence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"他持續（　）核心肌群，身體變得更加穩定有力。","n":22,"ssz":"..............1......."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[2].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"她隨著音樂（　）起舞，成為眾人的焦點。","n":19,"ssz":"....1.............."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[3].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這場義賣晚會是由國內各大廠商（　），義賣所得將全數捐出。","n":28,"ssz":"............................"},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[4].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"每一個人都有（　），但應適可而止，以免增加身體的負擔。","n":27,"ssz":"..1........................"},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[5].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"多給點時間吧！（　），一名偉大的投手也是需要花時間成長。","n":28,"ssz":"..........................1."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[6].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"畢業後，他特地回到母校（　）恩師，感謝老師多年的教導。","n":27,"ssz":"......1...................."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[7].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"養成運動習慣需要持之以恆，一旦（　），就可能退回原來的狀態。","n":30,"ssz":".............1................"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"請問第三段「多年的鍛鍊讓周天成的體脂率不到百分之五，但他對自己的要求從不鬆懈。」文中的「鍛鍊」可以用哪個詞語替換？","n":57,"ssz":"...................1............1..................1....."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"刻苦訓練","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"練習功夫","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"放鬆筋骨","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"排練演習","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"下列哪一項最不能直接看出周天成的自律？","n":19,"ssz":"...1..............."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"每天完成羽球基本訓練","n":10,"ssz":".........."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"羽球訓練結束後，繼續進行重量訓練","n":16,"s